Skill typescript.

This skill merges two MIT-licensed sources.

The skill text and the files in `rules/` come from the `typescript-magician` skill in [mcollina/skills](https://github.com/mcollina/skills) by Matteo Collina. Its license is in the `credits.md` file of this folder. The text was restyled for this plugin, and examples that current TypeScript no longer supports were corrected.

The facts in `typescript-6-7.md` come from the `typescript-knowledge-patch` in [nevaberry/nevaberry-plugins](https://github.com/nevaberry/nevaberry-plugins) by Nevaberry. That patch was extracted by a language model. Each kept fact was checked against the TypeScript release notes on typescriptlang.org, the TypeScript blog, or the microsoft/typescript-go repository. Facts that could not be confirmed were left out. The license of that source follows.

